# The image build context is ultimateteam/ (see deploy/Dockerfile). An allowlist: only what the server build needs, the
# bundled game data, and the client pack's inputs go in; never certificates, generated modulus files, personal
# settings, club data, logs, tooling or outputs.
*
!server/Directory.Build.props
!server/.editorconfig
!server/src/
!server/database-setup/
!runtime-source/ultimateteam21/
!client-pack/
!Aurora21-LocalAuthBridge.exe
!Aurora21-MathBridge.exe
# EA's own CA moduli, as the game ships them: the trust patch finds them in FIFA's memory to replace.
!runtime-source/gos2015-original-modulus.bin
!runtime-source/gs2019-original-modulus.bin
server/**/bin/
server/**/obj/
runtime-source/ultimateteam21/**/*.log
runtime-source/local-gos2015-modulus.bin
runtime-source/local-gs2019-modulus.bin
